<urn:atm:triage:finding/ATM-QA-003>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "ATM-QA-003" ;
  triage:title "No explicit named structural test proves localhost/own-IP never matched before peer-adapter routing branch" ;
  triage:description "Req-qa round 2 deliverable-missing finding on feature/pAI-s23-crosshost-shared-write-path @ 985a6d46. Sprint doc sub-task 4 (docs/plans/phase-ai/sprint-ai-23-crosshost-shared-write-path.md:181-182) requires: 'Structural test(s): prove that the host-routing-decision precedence ensures localhost / own-IP never match the dedicated peer adapter routing branch before the adapter tries to match it -- explicit named test, not indirect generic coverage'. Current state: only indirectly covered by pre-existing generic AI.12 host-routing-decision invariant in crates/atm-architecture/tests/boundary_enforcement.rs:167-227. No explicit named AI.23-specific structural test / AST assertion exists that directly proves localhost/own-IP are rejected before peer-adapter routing. Correction: add an explicit named structural test (e.g., test_peer_adapter_never_matches_localhost_or_own_ip in a new or existing test module) with AST assertions covering the precedence chain: WriteTarget::peer_route validation -> host check -> deduplicate peer identity -> then attempt adapter match." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-AI" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:category "test-coverage" ;
  triage:severity "important" ;
  triage:repeatable false ;
  triage:sweepScope "file_only" ;
  triage:status "fixed" ;
  triage:dispatchReady true ;
  triage:triagedAt "2026-07-26T00:55:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:closedAt "2026-07-26T21:30:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:closedBy "quality-mgr" ;
  triage:closureNote "Crimson-2f4c fixed on fix/close-out-pre-ai27-findings @ a5659742 (PR #656). ai23_peer_adapter_never_matches_localhost_or_own_ip (boundary_enforcement.rs:271-312) is an explicit named AST-based structural test matching the sprint-doc's actual ask (AST assertions, same pattern as the existing AI.12 invariant test) -- not a runtime-behavioral test, which the sprint doc did not require. Confirmed structurally distinct from ai23_ingress_adapters_cannot_own_write_side_effects (:318), which asserts a different invariant (write side-effect ownership, not host-routing precedence). cargo test -p atm-architecture --test boundary_enforcement ai23_peer_adapter_never_matches_localhost_or_own_ip: 1/1 pass. ruthless-boundary-qa independently confirmed the test follows the same AST-visitor conventions as its neighbors, not a new/inconsistent approach. CI green (8/8)." ;
  triage:foundIn triage:AICH-S3 ;
  triage:foundAt "2026-07-26T00:50:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:occurrence/ATM-QA-003/s23-1> ;
  triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:occurrence/ATM-QA-003/integrate-8750587b> ;
  triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:occurrence/ATM-QA-003/preai27-a5659742> ;
  triage:triageRecordVersion "1" .

